      "population": "The study will examine containerized distributed task execution workers (e.g., Hangfire/RabbitMQ background jobs), asynchronous LLM generation pipelines, monotonic fencing token protocols, network partition logs, and API token usage records during simulated worker timeouts and redelivery events.",
